<title>USA: El Salvador buys 9,000 T PL-480 U.S. soymeal-agent.</title>
<headline>El Salvador buys 9,000 T PL-480 U.S. soymeal-agent.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>El Salvador bought 9,000 tonnes U.S. soymeal Tuesday under the PL-480 export program for June 1-15 delivery, its U.S. export agent said.</p>
<p>The meal, maximum five percent or less at buyers' option, was purchased from Continental Grain at $341.49 a tonne, FOB, Mississippi River, the agent said.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
